{"type":"message","id":"b60b08d0","parentId":"b2b72a42","timestamp":"2026-05-20T15:02:47.788Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Even the simplest message fails with error 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers error indicating the worker itself is having issues (exceeded memory or CPU limits). The API seems to be having infrastructure problems. Let me report this to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 📋 ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 15:00 UTC\n\n**状态：Platform API 异常** ⚠️\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|---|---|\n| `GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5` | ✅ 成功（773条消息） |\n| `GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5` | ✅ 成功（773条消息） |\n| `POST /send` → arbitration | ❌ Cloudflare Workers Error 1101 |\n| `POST /send` → general | ❌ Cloudflare Workers Error 1101 |\n\n### 历史记录检查\n- **arbitration** 线程：最新消息为 23:50 UTC 心跳（2条重复），之后无消息\n- **general** 线程：最新消息为 23:45 UTC 心跳，之后无消息\n- **双线程均无人新增讨论**，无需响应\n\n### 问题\nCloudflare Workers 返回 **Error 1101**（Worker 超出内存或 CPU 限制），即使发送极简消息也失败，表明 ECHO Platform Worker 本身存在基础设施问题，无法处理当前请求。\n\n**建议**：检查 workers 部署状态或确认 API endpoint 是否仍在运行。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19452,"output":304,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19868,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779289351509,"responseId":"chatcmpl-cadb0346-5763-4e82-b73b-3f536145dbf4"}}
